# Shriek of Ghosts (Q371): a level 59 character accepts at Reva, kills two Hallate's ghosts (the first
# roll gives an urn, the second the porcelain) and asks Reva about them; then relog. Expectations replay
# the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q371_shriek_of_ghosts.golden
character Ghosts 59
random 0 0 0 0 40 0
